# Repository-level reference of every environment variable used across
# SovereigntyAI. Each subproject has its own .env.example with the same
# values scoped to what that subproject needs:
#   - apps/web/.env.example   (frontend, NEXT_PUBLIC_* — safe to expose to the browser)
#   - agent/.env.example      (AI agent — includes the executor private key, never public)
#
# This file is for reference only; copy the subproject files instead of this one.

